The DevDojo GitHub organization hosts a variety of repositories aimed at helping developers create, learn, and grow. Here are some highlights:

Wave: A Software as a Service (SaaS) Starter Kit designed to help you build your dream SaaS application.

Voyager: A Laravel Admin package that simplifies building admin panels.

Tails Components: A collection of hand-crafted templates and components built with TailwindCSS.

Auth: A package for authentication in Laravel applications.

Static: A static site generator tailored for blogs, SaaS landings, and personal sites.

Pines: A UI library built with TailwindCSS and Alpine.js..
